.{
    .name = .notary,
    .fingerprint = 0x1c66b255a707070,
    .version = "0.1.0",
    .minimum_zig_version = "0.16.0",
    .dependencies = .{
        // The Native SDK framework, pinned to a commit. `native eject` wrote a
        // machine-local `.path` into somebody's npm install here, which is
        // reproducible on exactly one computer: every CI runner and every
        // contributor built against whatever CLI version happened to be
        // installed, and a release was whatever npm served that afternoon.
        //
        // Bump this and the CLI version in .github/workflows/*.yml IN THE SAME
        // COMMIT. The automation harness refuses to read a snapshot when the
        // CLI and the framework speak different protocol versions, and moving
        // one alone does not fail the build: it silently breaks every live
        // test.
        //
        // A fork rather than vercel-labs/native, for four patches, all of them
        // in the renderer Linux presents with. Two of them are Notary's:
        //
        //   * medium and bold ink REGULAR outlines off macOS, because the
        //     toolkit bundles no face for the weight ids it maps spans onto, so
        //     every heading in this window is flat on Linux
        //     (vercel-labs/native#423);
        //   * a codepoint the bundled faces do not carry is painted as a solid
        //     block, and the approval prompt shows the CLIENT's name, so a
        //     client named in Japanese would be a row of rectangles on the
        //     screen where somebody decides whether to sign
        //     (vercel-labs/native#421).
        //
        // The other two are the colour emoji this window does not draw and the
        // Linux present path's dirty rectangle, which it gets for free.
        //
        // PATCHES.md in the fork is the tracker: a row per patch with its
        // upstream issue and how to drop it when that issue closes. Also
        // reachable as the tag `plaza-linux-gaps-2`, so this does not depend on
        // one branch surviving.
        .native_sdk = .{
            .url = "git+https://github.com/zig-nostr/native.git#a90ee35d7813dfd5e4d55a053e29067e704c4e7a",
            .hash = "native_sdk-0.1.0-hzDzQkVysQJeCEkO1f6kfnZt7cQ0YNriPiqOdn_CAYXg",
        },
    },
    .paths = .{ "build.zig", "build.zig.zon", "src", "assets", "app.zon" },
}
